<p>Darktrace is a pioneering AI cybersecurity company that uses self-learning AI to detect and respond to cyber threats across the entire digital infrastructure. Unlike signature-based solutions, Darktrace learns the "pattern of life" for every user, device, and network to identify anomalous behavior.</p>
<p>The platform's flagship Antigena technology provides autonomous response capabilities, taking action to neutralize threats in real-time without human intervention. This is particularly valuable for fast-moving attacks where human response times are insufficient.</p>
<p>Darktrace covers network, email, cloud, endpoints, and OT/IoT environments, providing unified visibility and protection across the entire digital estate.</p>
